If possible, this should be disabled. Otherwise, refer to [https://modsecurity.org/documentation/ mod_security documentation] or contact your host\'s support if you encounter random errors.',
	'messages:config-diff3-bad' => 'en:GNU diff3 text comparison utility not found. You can ignore this for now, but might run into edit conflicts more frequently.',
	'messages:config-git' => 'en:Found the Git version control software: <code>$1</code>.',
